---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for interpretChange. Compare approved design revisions and change rationale to identify functional, interface, and process effects. Separate editorial drawing updates from meaningful changes and preserve requirements that remain binding despite a local modification. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
